Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5\fscx98\fscy98}Players who got in TROUBLE\Nthe day before a derby
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:02.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Back in October
